WEBVTT

00:00:02.064 --> 00:00:03.634
What happened to Yoshikawa?

00:00:03.634 --> 00:00:05.604
Where's my brother?

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.294
Yoshikawa!
Big Brother!

00:00:08.404 --> 00:00:10.164
Michiru! What are you doing?

00:00:10.644 --> 00:00:11.664
Give Haruo back!

00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:19.104
See ya, Big Sister.

00:00:19.184 --> 00:00:20.514
Michiru! Wait!

00:00:20.514 --> 00:00:21.384
Michiru!

00:00:21.884 --> 00:00:23.354
No way...

00:00:23.724 --> 00:00:26.584
No way! No way!

00:00:27.624 --> 00:00:29.684
HARUO!

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.664
Deep, deep inside the mansion...

00:00:39.664 --> 00:00:43.474
I found it inside a secret room
that no one knew about...

00:00:43.474 --> 00:00:48.174
It was a big mirror, and its beauty was mesmerizing.

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:56.444
Hey, Bunny, who do you think this kid is?

00:00:56.784 --> 00:00:59.724
I wonder if he's someone that
I'm going to marry in the future.

00:00:59.724 --> 00:01:02.094
And he's gonna give me a big smooch

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:04.794
and tell me that I'm the most important person
to him in the whole wide world!

00:01:04.794 --> 00:01:07.924
And we're gonna live happily ever after!

00:01:08.294 --> 00:01:09.794
I can't wait to see him!

00:01:09.794 --> 00:01:12.854
I wonder if he's going to like me.

00:01:13.574 --> 00:01:16.404
That was how I met him.

00:01:16.404 --> 00:01:20.204
And his name is... Haruo Yoshikawa.

00:01:22.614 --> 00:01:24.134
Haruo?

00:01:24.714 --> 00:01:29.744
Episode 13
Magi? It's the Final Episode?

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:33.184
Lady Ayumi. Lady Ayumi.

00:01:33.184 --> 00:01:34.744
Where are you going, in that condition?

00:01:34.824 --> 00:01:35.994
Isn't it obvious?

00:01:35.994 --> 00:01:37.494
I'm going to rescue Haruo!

00:01:37.494 --> 00:01:38.824
But Lady Ayumi...

00:01:38.824 --> 00:01:40.994
If I say I'm going, I'M GOING!

00:01:40.994 --> 00:01:42.034
You got a problem with that?

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:43.464
We're coming, too!

00:01:44.004 --> 00:01:44.984
You guys!

00:01:45.364 --> 00:01:49.634
You see, it's against school regulations for me to
let you go be with Yoshikawa all by yourself!

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:52.544
I don't care if she's your sister or whatever,

00:01:52.544 --> 00:01:55.014
but I will not tolerate anyone
who'd kidnap MY brother!

00:01:56.544 --> 00:01:59.314
Big Sis... Please, just calm down!

00:01:59.314 --> 00:02:02.514
When it comes to Big Brother Haruo,
she tends to lose herself...

00:02:02.584 --> 00:02:03.824
I'm coming, too!

00:02:03.824 --> 00:02:08.024
Rescuing the Holy Being, Senior Yoshikawa, from
the evil witch means a lot more to me than to you!

00:02:08.024 --> 00:02:09.754
It is my duty, after all!

00:02:09.894 --> 00:02:13.024
Hmph! You guys are really nosey, you know that?

00:02:13.024 --> 00:02:14.264
Just do whatever you want.

00:02:14.264 --> 00:02:15.284
Please wait.

00:02:16.064 --> 00:02:17.564
What, are you still gonna try to stop us?

00:02:17.564 --> 00:02:20.404
You see everyone's all fired-up
and ready to go, right?

00:02:20.404 --> 00:02:22.934
I am not going to force you to stay. However...

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:23.774
Hmm?

00:02:23.774 --> 00:02:28.544
Because of the curse of the Mirror of the Future,
your magical power has been unstable.

00:02:29.274 --> 00:02:31.614
So if you really are going,
you should take THAT with you...

00:02:31.614 --> 00:02:35.104
But that's the last thing I want to use, though...

00:02:37.224 --> 00:02:39.884
Looks like you need me again!

00:02:39.884 --> 00:02:43.014
Don't worry, just sit back and watch!
With my magic, I can make boys go crazy over you!

00:02:44.394 --> 00:02:47.934
I don't have to make anyone like me this time!

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:51.634
I'm just gonna borrow that triple-magical-power
of yours real quick!

00:02:51.634 --> 00:02:53.304
Oh well, whatever!

00:02:53.304 --> 00:02:56.794
As long as you put me on, I don't care!

00:02:57.144 --> 00:03:00.344
Hmm? It feels pretty smooth on my back.

00:03:00.344 --> 00:03:01.414
You shaved it off?

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.484
It got burnt because of Michiru!

00:03:03.484 --> 00:03:07.484
H-Hey, that has nothing to do with this,
you perverted cat!

00:03:07.484 --> 00:03:08.914
Talking panties...

00:03:08.914 --> 00:03:11.224
Yeah, that's an interesting choice.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:12.684
What wicked taste she has!

00:03:13.624 --> 00:03:16.644
But you know, my magical power
will be tripled because of this!

00:03:16.894 --> 00:03:20.024
Now, let's go get Haruo back!

00:03:22.664 --> 00:03:24.754
Senior Yoshikawa!

00:03:25.834 --> 00:03:27.764
Ready? I'm gonna open it!

00:03:28.404 --> 00:03:30.634
O locked gate to the magical world...

00:03:33.574 --> 00:03:36.704
Open your heavy gates before us!

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:45.554
It's open!

00:03:45.884 --> 00:03:47.444
Let's go! Hang on!

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:50.184
You wait, Michiru...

00:03:50.694 --> 00:03:52.494
Hang in there, Haruo!

00:04:15.714 --> 00:04:18.554
You're already mine.

00:04:18.554 --> 00:04:20.924
I won't let my sister take you away from me.

00:04:21.354 --> 00:04:24.894
Now, the curse on her will never be lifted.

00:04:24.894 --> 00:04:26.994
And in that event,

00:04:26.994 --> 00:04:32.664
the next head of the Mamiya family will be ME.

00:04:37.544 --> 00:04:40.074
Michiru! Michiru!

00:04:40.074 --> 00:04:41.614
What are you doing in there, Michiru?

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:42.774
Open the door!

00:04:42.774 --> 00:04:45.714
You're not allowed in this room!

00:04:45.944 --> 00:04:47.284
Michiru!

00:04:50.014 --> 00:04:50.824
Michiru!

00:04:50.824 --> 00:04:53.284
How annoying... SHUT UP!

00:04:55.794 --> 00:04:57.264
This is wonderful!

00:04:57.264 --> 00:05:00.164
I can feel something gushing
from deep inside my body!

00:05:00.164 --> 00:05:01.964
Incredible!

00:05:02.034 --> 00:05:04.864
With this power, I can be the
ruler of the magic world,

00:05:04.864 --> 00:05:08.824
no, the entire world!

00:05:18.244 --> 00:05:21.914
For your safety, please stay behind the yellow line.

00:05:23.014 --> 00:05:24.054
We're here!

00:05:24.054 --> 00:05:25.824
I haven't been back here for a while...

00:05:25.824 --> 00:05:27.554
So this is the evil magic world!

00:05:28.924 --> 00:05:30.914
What is it? What is it that I'm feeling?

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:33.594
I've never felt such malice before.

00:05:33.594 --> 00:05:34.794
It's...

00:05:34.794 --> 00:05:36.594
coming from that direction!

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:39.034
Just like I thought...

00:05:39.034 --> 00:05:41.594
That's my house...

00:05:43.844 --> 00:05:45.774
Give me some more!

00:05:45.774 --> 00:05:50.514
Give me what's inside you! Oh yeah, this is great!

00:05:50.514 --> 00:05:52.884
Let me feel more of it!

00:05:52.884 --> 00:05:58.874
That power to rule the world!
Yes! This is unbelievable!

00:06:00.224 --> 00:06:01.454
Michiru!

00:06:01.554 --> 00:06:03.114
Give Haruo back!

00:06:03.724 --> 00:06:06.324
Oh, hi, Big Sister.

00:06:06.324 --> 00:06:10.284
It's tacky to interrupt your little sister's secret affair!

00:06:11.004 --> 00:06:12.034
Big Brother!

00:06:12.034 --> 00:06:14.434
You bitch! What did you do to Yoshikawa?

00:06:14.434 --> 00:06:17.244
Senior... Senior...

00:06:17.244 --> 00:06:19.604
Michiru... How dare you!

00:06:19.604 --> 00:06:21.174
Oh my...

00:06:21.174 --> 00:06:23.984
I deserve to be praised for this, not yelled at.

00:06:23.984 --> 00:06:27.714
Look how quickly I drew out this
Demon King's magical power,

00:06:27.714 --> 00:06:31.414
while you guys spent almost a year
but couldn't accomplish anything.

00:06:31.584 --> 00:06:33.154
Did you say "Demon King"?!

00:06:33.154 --> 00:06:36.854
There's no way Yoshikawa is... the Demon King!

00:06:37.164 --> 00:06:39.894
Get away from Senior Yoshikawa!

00:06:45.764 --> 00:06:47.904
Oh no! Yuri! Nijihara!

00:06:47.904 --> 00:06:49.874
Her magical power's incredible!

00:06:49.874 --> 00:06:52.344
And that's the power
Big Brother Haruo possessed?!

00:06:52.344 --> 00:06:56.144
That's right, and it tasted delicious.

00:06:57.044 --> 00:06:58.384
How dare you!

00:06:58.384 --> 00:06:59.714
I'm gonna make you pay for this!

00:07:06.724 --> 00:07:08.854
Give Big Brother Haruo back!

00:07:11.994 --> 00:07:13.584
Why you!

00:07:20.134 --> 00:07:22.664
It seems that attacking her separately
actually worked against us.

00:07:24.774 --> 00:07:29.304
Well, what's your next move, Big Sister?

00:07:29.944 --> 00:07:33.244
Fine! I'll fight you with everything I've got!

00:07:33.244 --> 00:07:36.854
Lady Ayumi, please try not to
hit your allies with that.

00:07:36.854 --> 00:07:39.654
I'll give it a shot! I'll do whatever I can!

00:07:39.654 --> 00:07:40.724
Hey, stupid cat!

00:07:40.724 --> 00:07:42.394
You didn't have to call me "stupid."

00:07:42.394 --> 00:07:43.924
We're gonna go all out, you hear?

00:07:43.924 --> 00:07:46.054
Yeah, but try not to tear me, all right?

00:07:48.364 --> 00:07:50.884
Core Break!

00:07:52.104 --> 00:07:53.964
Oh, give us a break, Lady Ayumi.

00:07:57.204 --> 00:08:00.144
What's that noise? What's going on?

00:08:07.084 --> 00:08:10.924
Lady Ayumi, I suggest you go a little easy on her.

00:08:10.924 --> 00:08:12.384
Michiru...

00:08:12.384 --> 00:08:14.554
She's always been a thick skulled sister,

00:08:14.554 --> 00:08:16.954
but I never thought things would turn out this way!

00:08:17.494 --> 00:08:19.794
What do you mean you never thought
things would turn out this way?

00:08:23.294 --> 00:08:24.424
Michiru?!

00:08:26.434 --> 00:08:27.574
My legs!

00:08:27.574 --> 00:08:28.734
Lady Ayumi!

00:08:31.404 --> 00:08:32.534
Rika!

00:08:33.874 --> 00:08:37.344
Big Sister... You're special...

00:08:37.344 --> 00:08:40.184
So I'm gonna take my time and
freeze you from INSIDE.

00:08:40.184 --> 00:08:42.314
Michiru, you...

00:08:45.284 --> 00:08:47.814
My back is cold!

00:08:51.224 --> 00:08:53.954
Ha... Haruo...

00:09:32.064 --> 00:09:33.134
This can't be happening!

00:09:33.134 --> 00:09:36.124
I thought I sucked all the power
out of the Demon King!

00:09:36.474 --> 00:09:37.844
The power...

00:09:37.844 --> 00:09:40.444
I'm losing the power of the Demon King...

00:09:40.444 --> 00:09:41.744
Why?

00:09:41.744 --> 00:09:43.044
It's almost time, huh?

00:09:43.044 --> 00:09:44.234
You!

00:09:48.414 --> 00:09:50.814
What... are you?

00:09:58.194 --> 00:09:59.924
Hey, Mamiya!

00:09:59.924 --> 00:10:01.294
Wake up, Mamiya!

00:10:03.194 --> 00:10:06.264
What happened to us?

00:10:06.264 --> 00:10:08.934
More importantly, take a look at that!

00:10:08.934 --> 00:10:10.074
What?

00:10:10.074 --> 00:10:13.404
What's that? Where's my brother?

00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:19.684
Over there... is that my house?

00:10:19.684 --> 00:10:20.754
Where is Father?

00:10:20.754 --> 00:10:22.474
Father is right here.

00:10:22.984 --> 00:10:24.454
You!

00:10:24.584 --> 00:10:27.694
Michiru! Don't tell me Father is...

00:10:27.694 --> 00:10:30.494
He just passed out from the shock of teleporting.

00:10:30.494 --> 00:10:32.484
What did you do to my Big Brother Haruo?

00:10:33.194 --> 00:10:35.124
The Demon King has awoken.

00:10:35.594 --> 00:10:36.164
What?

00:10:36.164 --> 00:10:36.734
What do you mean?
What?

00:10:36.734 --> 00:10:37.324
What do you mean?

00:10:37.534 --> 00:10:41.804
That is that man's... Haruo Yoshikawa's true form!

00:10:41.804 --> 00:10:43.404
What are you talking about?

00:10:43.404 --> 00:10:45.604
You're the one who made my brother look like that!

00:10:45.604 --> 00:10:48.004
Bring Senior Yoshikawa back to normal!

00:10:48.274 --> 00:10:50.834
No! She's not responsible for this.

00:10:51.744 --> 00:10:53.084
Miss Hongo?!

00:10:53.084 --> 00:10:56.654
Haruo Yoshikawa is the core of the Demon King
who has been sealed away.

00:10:56.654 --> 00:11:00.524
And now, the Demon King has been resurrected.

00:11:00.524 --> 00:11:04.484
What's really going on?!

00:11:09.234 --> 00:11:11.164
I can't hear anything...

00:11:12.864 --> 00:11:16.594
A world with no sense of reality...

00:11:17.544 --> 00:11:22.004
Just... who am I...

00:11:22.774 --> 00:11:23.744
Haruo!

00:11:27.014 --> 00:11:28.214
Haruo!

00:11:30.384 --> 00:11:31.784
What in the world is going on?!

00:11:31.784 --> 00:11:33.054
That's the Demon King?

00:11:33.054 --> 00:11:34.224
That's right.

00:11:34.224 --> 00:11:38.124
The one who swallows the entire world
and turns it into nothingness.

00:11:38.124 --> 00:11:42.534
It's still at its first stage, without a will, but...

00:11:43.064 --> 00:11:45.694
Swallows the entire world?

00:11:46.334 --> 00:11:48.234
A long, long time ago,

00:11:48.234 --> 00:11:51.334
the six sages of the sealing magic
sealed away the Demon King.

00:11:52.504 --> 00:11:57.344
They did so because they weren't able to defeat the
Demon King, who possessed tremendous power,

00:11:57.344 --> 00:12:01.574
and the only thing they could do was seal
his magical power in the mirror.

00:12:04.284 --> 00:12:07.324
However, the seal wasn't quite secure.

00:12:07.324 --> 00:12:12.194
And because of that, the Demon King has come
very close to full awakening many times before.

00:12:12.594 --> 00:12:14.134
Many times?

00:12:14.134 --> 00:12:19.654
And the countermeasure the Department of Magic
came up with was to reverse time.

00:12:20.064 --> 00:12:21.904
Reverse time?

00:12:21.904 --> 00:12:22.674
That's right.

00:12:22.674 --> 00:12:24.574
If it can't be re-sealed,

00:12:24.574 --> 00:12:27.204
turning back the clock to the time before the seal
was broken will solve the problem.

00:12:27.204 --> 00:12:28.404
Miss Hongo?

00:12:28.714 --> 00:12:30.974
Time is programmed to reverse for a year.

00:12:31.144 --> 00:12:32.784
In other words,

00:12:32.784 --> 00:12:36.544
all of you have been repeating
the same year over and over again.

00:12:37.184 --> 00:12:40.324
No way! I don't recall that at all!

00:12:40.324 --> 00:12:43.254
Time has been stopped.
Of course you don't recall it!

00:12:43.254 --> 00:12:44.594
Hey, wait a second!

00:12:44.594 --> 00:12:47.064
Miss Hongo! Who exactly are you?

00:12:47.834 --> 00:12:50.764
She's probably a cyborg, too.

00:12:51.004 --> 00:12:52.434
What?!

00:12:53.104 --> 00:12:57.194
She's right! I was created to reverse time.

00:12:57.474 --> 00:12:59.474
And up until now

00:12:59.474 --> 00:13:03.304
I've been watching the Demon King and
all of you, who greatly influence him!

00:13:07.114 --> 00:13:08.084
Miss Hongo!

00:13:22.834 --> 00:13:24.234
Demon King...

00:13:24.704 --> 00:13:26.534
Haruo Yoshikawa...

00:13:27.604 --> 00:13:30.404
O time that has been flowing
since time immemorial...

00:13:32.444 --> 00:13:38.204
By my life... Become one with the
enormous soul and reverse!

00:13:40.784 --> 00:13:41.974
Demon King...

00:13:43.114 --> 00:13:44.814
Together with me...

00:13:46.154 --> 00:13:48.584
Disappear into the gap of time!

00:13:55.264 --> 00:13:56.324
What's this?!

00:14:04.804 --> 00:14:06.064
Miss Hongo!

00:14:07.614 --> 00:14:09.274
It failed after all...

00:14:10.614 --> 00:14:16.604
My body is programmed to tune with
the Demon King's biorhythm.

00:14:17.214 --> 00:14:20.254
And every time it turns back time,

00:14:20.254 --> 00:14:23.394
another me who is standing by
is programmed to awaken.

00:14:23.394 --> 00:14:25.964
However, that wasn't the case this time.

00:14:25.964 --> 00:14:29.124
It seems that there have been some changes
in Haruo Yoshikawa's emotions.

00:14:29.364 --> 00:14:32.034
And because of that, an unexpected
awakening was triggered

00:14:32.034 --> 00:14:35.994
and now I'm no longer able to
reverse time by myself.

00:14:36.274 --> 00:14:37.864
No way...

00:14:38.444 --> 00:14:41.514
Are you saying that my brother
can't be turned back to himself?

00:14:41.514 --> 00:14:42.774
There is a way.

00:14:43.974 --> 00:14:48.714
All of you can help me activate
the magic to reverse time.

00:14:48.884 --> 00:14:50.654
We can?!

00:14:50.654 --> 00:14:52.724
Just now, inside of the Demon King's heart...

00:14:52.724 --> 00:14:54.924
there were memories of you.

00:14:54.924 --> 00:14:58.754
In other words, I believe that you can tune with him.

00:14:59.024 --> 00:15:03.554
If that's successful, we may be
able to turn back time.

00:15:03.834 --> 00:15:07.464
That is the only way to save Haruo Yoshikawa.

00:15:07.464 --> 00:15:11.044
For Senior Yoshikawa I'd gladly sacrifice myself!

00:15:11.044 --> 00:15:12.474
Me, too!

00:15:12.874 --> 00:15:15.514
This is a very dangerous task for people
of flesh and blood like you.

00:15:15.514 --> 00:15:17.114
So what?

00:15:17.114 --> 00:15:18.844
I'm going to save Haruo!

00:15:18.844 --> 00:15:21.884
Wrong! I'm the one who's going to save my brother!

00:15:21.884 --> 00:15:23.284
Oh yeah, she's right!

00:15:23.284 --> 00:15:24.214
Yeah!

00:15:24.384 --> 00:15:25.524
And...

00:15:25.524 --> 00:15:27.284
YOU are going to help, too.

00:15:27.284 --> 00:15:28.494
What?

00:15:28.494 --> 00:15:29.854
Hold on to that.

00:15:30.224 --> 00:15:31.664
In order to seal the Demon King,

00:15:31.664 --> 00:15:34.124
you'll need a catalyst with his emotions in it.

00:15:34.734 --> 00:15:36.164
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:36.164 --> 00:15:37.834
Why do you have to bring Michiru into this?

00:15:37.834 --> 00:15:41.324
Because she's also a part of the reason why
Haruo Yoshikawa was activated in the first place.

00:15:41.604 --> 00:15:44.904
Memories of you already reside within Haruo.

00:15:45.104 --> 00:15:46.844
You're probably not going to succeed

00:15:46.844 --> 00:15:49.614
unless all females who have any relationship
with Yoshikawa work together on this.

00:15:49.614 --> 00:15:53.544
O-Okay! Then I guess I have no choice!

00:15:53.544 --> 00:15:56.454
I'm totally reluctant about this, but I'll help you.

00:15:56.454 --> 00:15:58.454
What's up with that attitude?!

00:15:58.454 --> 00:16:01.424
This is all your fault to begin with!

00:16:01.424 --> 00:16:02.594
Let's go!

00:16:02.594 --> 00:16:05.114
I'm sure it's already begun to affect other worlds.

00:16:08.894 --> 00:16:12.434
And here I was thinking that I might be able to
run into Miss Yuri if I came to school...

00:16:12.434 --> 00:16:14.024
Check it out, Sora!

00:16:14.334 --> 00:16:15.734
I have no doubt about it!

00:16:15.734 --> 00:16:17.674
This must be the work of aliens!

00:16:18.004 --> 00:16:18.974
That's right!

00:16:18.974 --> 00:16:21.644
Now's the time to fully utilize the items
filled with love and justice,

00:16:21.644 --> 00:16:24.284
and explore the secrets of space!

00:16:24.284 --> 00:16:27.654
Looks like our students are
flying in the sky, Mr. Principal!
And explore the secrets of space!

00:16:27.654 --> 00:16:30.984
There, there, Vice-Principal, just calm down.

00:16:30.984 --> 00:16:32.384
Ain't that right, Satoru?

00:16:32.384 --> 00:16:34.854
There, there, Vice-Principal.
There, there, Vice-Principal.

00:16:35.454 --> 00:16:36.284
What's that?

00:16:43.134 --> 00:16:46.464
Now we will attempt to reverse time as a group!

00:16:47.604 --> 00:16:48.594
Mamiya!

00:16:49.334 --> 00:16:52.104
You're my replacement. Go!

00:16:55.114 --> 00:16:58.914
Haruo, I'm coming to save you right now.

00:16:59.984 --> 00:17:02.314
Here we go! Begin activating the magic!

00:17:02.314 --> 00:17:03.414
All right!

00:17:09.794 --> 00:17:11.394
Ready to jump, you stupid cat?

00:17:11.394 --> 00:17:12.584
I'm ready whenever you are!

00:17:19.834 --> 00:17:22.234
He's resisting harder than I expected...

00:17:22.234 --> 00:17:23.674
Can we do this?

00:17:26.744 --> 00:17:28.674
What incredible power!

00:17:28.674 --> 00:17:30.174
It feels like I'm gonna burn to a crisp!

00:17:30.174 --> 00:17:31.244
Stupid cat!

00:17:31.244 --> 00:17:32.784
Don't worry about a thing!

00:17:32.784 --> 00:17:35.304
I'd put my life on line for a chick who'd wear me!

00:17:36.284 --> 00:17:38.684
'Cuz I sure don't want her to take me off!

00:17:39.654 --> 00:17:42.354
Stop it! This is so not like you!

00:17:48.864 --> 00:17:50.224
Haruo?!

00:18:06.144 --> 00:18:07.414
The magic circle!

00:18:10.854 --> 00:18:14.484
I can't keep up the barrier!
I'm gonna burn at this rate!

00:18:14.624 --> 00:18:17.994
Ha... Haruo! Stop it!

00:18:26.164 --> 00:18:27.494
Stupid cat!

00:18:30.934 --> 00:18:32.404
What do you think you're doing?!

00:18:32.404 --> 00:18:34.394
If you use that much magical power you'll...

00:18:46.554 --> 00:18:49.044
I... I'm saved?

00:18:49.794 --> 00:18:52.154
Hey, you did it, you stupid cat!

00:18:53.364 --> 00:18:54.884
Stupid... cat...

00:18:57.534 --> 00:18:58.694
Hey, you!

00:19:00.304 --> 00:19:02.904
If the world was destroyed,

00:19:02.904 --> 00:19:05.674
I wouldn't get to be worn by you
anymore, now would I?

00:19:05.674 --> 00:19:09.174
Oh no... What are you talking about?

00:19:09.174 --> 00:19:13.234
You gotta save that loser, all right?

00:19:13.584 --> 00:19:15.574
Stupid... cat...

00:19:16.484 --> 00:19:21.944
This is unusual, huh...
To come off on my own like this...

00:19:22.994 --> 00:19:26.084
Stupid cat!

00:19:30.264 --> 00:19:31.824
What is the meaning of this?

00:19:32.934 --> 00:19:34.574
Does this mean it was just impossible?

00:19:34.574 --> 00:19:36.274
These girls' thoughts...

00:19:36.274 --> 00:19:38.534
...are no longer going to reach Haruo Yoshikawa?

00:19:52.684 --> 00:19:54.124
Haruo...

00:19:55.194 --> 00:19:58.524
I don't... care about the curse anymore...

00:19:58.824 --> 00:20:01.264
I don't care about the power of the Demon King...

00:20:01.564 --> 00:20:03.994
But I WILL save Haruo no matter what!

00:20:03.994 --> 00:20:06.804
That's right! Because of Yoshikawa,

00:20:06.804 --> 00:20:08.964
I've been able to discipline myself all this time!

00:20:09.174 --> 00:20:12.864
I... I love my brother so much!

00:20:13.344 --> 00:20:16.174
I can't even think of a life without Big Bro!

00:20:16.444 --> 00:20:18.414
He can be clumsy sometimes, but...

00:20:18.784 --> 00:20:22.304
Senior Yoshikawa himself is the very person
who's going to save the world!

00:20:22.854 --> 00:20:25.914
It is my duty to protect Master Haruo.

00:20:26.384 --> 00:20:30.414
You just watch... I'll be sure to
make you mine NEXT TIME!

00:20:30.654 --> 00:20:37.324
I... I've always been in love with you
from the moment I first saw you!

00:20:41.204 --> 00:20:43.564
This power... We can do this!

00:20:47.644 --> 00:20:50.444
O time that has been flowing
since time immemorial...

00:20:50.714 --> 00:20:55.204
By our lives... Become one with
the enormous soul and reverse!

00:20:56.554 --> 00:20:57.714
Demon King!

00:20:57.714 --> 00:21:00.484
Together with us, return to the gap of time!

00:21:06.664 --> 00:21:08.754
Haruo!

00:21:27.954 --> 00:21:30.414
Mamiya...

00:21:31.354 --> 00:21:33.014
Haruo...

00:21:45.864 --> 00:21:46.794
Haruo...

00:21:58.084 --> 00:22:01.044
MAGIKANO

00:22:07.554 --> 00:22:13.964
This is a secret, but I am a little different

00:22:13.964 --> 00:22:20.164
Do I look ordinary or cute? Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:20.164 --> 00:22:23.634
I know I'm mellow and mediocre

00:22:23.634 --> 00:22:26.704
But so what? So what?

00:22:26.704 --> 00:22:29.814
But just as I was thinking that

00:22:29.814 --> 00:22:33.184
I got myself mixed up in trouble

00:22:33.184 --> 00:22:36.184
I'm not going to lose, I'm not going to give you up

00:22:36.184 --> 00:22:39.484
Because you are precious to me

00:22:39.484 --> 00:22:46.014
Maybe I should not cast a spell

00:22:47.464 --> 00:22:50.734
I don't want magic to be

00:22:50.734 --> 00:22:53.864
The reason why it's this way

00:22:53.864 --> 00:23:00.404
When it comes to love, it has to be real

00:23:00.404 --> 00:23:06.814
Who are you in love with?

00:23:06.814 --> 00:23:13.084
Everyone is dying to know the answer!

00:23:13.084 --> 00:23:16.294
Seriously, I have to guard you
from the love scramble that is about to begin

00:23:16.294 --> 00:23:18.124
It's a pinch! Here comes my punch!

00:23:26.634 --> 00:23:29.174
Perfect attendance was what I was
most proud of at school.

00:23:29.174 --> 00:23:31.544
And living for a long time was the
dream I had for the future.

00:23:31.544 --> 00:23:34.104
A decent middle school student
who was plain and average.

00:23:34.104 --> 00:23:36.474
That's how I, Haruo Yoshikawa, was back then.

00:23:37.014 --> 00:23:40.574
That's right... Until the day I saw her
on the way home from school,

00:23:40.684 --> 00:23:45.914
while the beautiful cherry blossoms
danced in the spring breeze...
